#   computed_properties_3 - ComputedProperties: equality, text, content, cursor, shadows
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ComputedProperties.cpp (lines 891-1398): operator==, the text
#       readers (anchor, alignment, justification, overflow, rendering, underline, tab-size,
#       word-break, spacing, white-space, decoration, transform, indent), the line and outline
#       styles, float, caret-color, clear, column-span, `content` (with quotes and counters),
#       content-visibility, cursor, visibility, display, list-style, overflow and the box and
